{"id":"f6f85367d1780fad","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-so-no-completeness.md","title":"No Complete Proof System for Full Second-Order Logic","display":"thm-so-no-completeness — No Complete Proof System for Full Second-Order Logic","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-so-no-completeness","aliases":["57-thm-so-no-completeness"],"display":"thm-so-no-completeness — No Complete Proof System for Full Second-Order Logic","depends_on":["[[57-df-so-semantics]]","[[57-df-S-ar]]","[[57-df-so-sentence]]","[[57-thm-so-nat]]","[[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-so-no-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-so-no-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-so-no-completeness — No Complete Proof System for Full Second-Order Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"521852a49020f617\" href=\"?note=521852a49020f617\" title=\"57-df-so-semantics\">57-df-so-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e637b613a7ac0c5\" href=\"?note=6e637b613a7ac0c5\" title=\"57-df-S-ar\">57-df-S-ar</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fcf8e66483555f57\" href=\"?note=fcf8e66483555f57\" title=\"57-df-so-sentence\">57-df-so-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ca21511bbcedbcd\" href=\"?note=4ca21511bbcedbcd\" title=\"57-thm-so-nat\">57-thm-so-nat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9f2c37860ff19d3b\" href=\"?note=9f2c37860ff19d3b\" title=\"57-df-recursively-enumerable\">57-df-recursively-enumerable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(S=\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SO}\">\\(\\mathrm{SO}\\)</span> 使用完全二阶语义。固定二阶有限语法树的有效单射编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N\\)</span>：编码像可判定，各构造子及识别、取子树运算可计算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是固定具有可计算逆的可计算双射。证明系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span> 表示证书编号与结论编号的关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9f2c37860ff19d3b\" href=\"?note=9f2c37860ff19d3b\" title=\"57-df-recursively-enumerable\">57-df-recursively-enumerable</a> 的数集类。下述 Sound、Complete 均相对这些固定数据定义；不对任意不可有效枚举的公理真类宣称不可能性。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2\">\\(\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fcf8e66483555f57\" href=\"?note=fcf8e66483555f57\" title=\"57-df-so-sentence\">57-df-so-sentence</a> 中两类变量均无自由出现的二阶句子集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})\">\\(\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})\\)</span> 是本原子下式定义的可靠性、完备性谓词，环境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g\">\\(S,g\\)</span> 和完全二阶语义固定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Code}(\\mathcal P)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle d,e\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}:\\langle d,e\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Code}(\\mathcal P)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle d,e\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}:\\langle d,e\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\langle d,e\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2\\;(e=g(\\sigma)\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;\\mathfrak A\\models_S^2\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sound}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\langle d,e\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2\\;(e=g(\\sigma)\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;\\mathfrak A\\models_S^2\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2\\;\\left[(\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;\\mathfrak A\\models_S^2\\sigma)\\to\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\langle d,g(\\sigma)\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2\\;\\left[(\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;\\mathfrak A\\models_S^2\\sigma)\\to\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\langle d,g(\\sigma)\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\;[\\operatorname{Code}(\\mathcal P)\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land\\mathrm{Sound}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})\\land\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\;[\\operatorname{Code}(\\mathcal P)\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land\\mathrm{Sound}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})\\land\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>限制是不存在可靠且完备的有效可枚举证明系统。若不要求有效性，把全部有效句直接作为公理即可得到反例，原无限制断言不成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-so-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"521852a49020f617","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-S-ar","status":"resolved","id":"6e637b613a7ac0c5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-S-ar]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"fcf8e66483555f57","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-so-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-thm-so-nat","status":"resolved","id":"4ca21511bbcedbcd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-thm-so-nat]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-recursively-enumerable","status":"resolved","id":"9f2c37860ff19d3b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-recursively-enumerable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-recursively-enumerable","status":"resolved","id":"9f2c37860ff19d3b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S=\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$。$\\mathrm{SO}$ 使用完全二阶语义。固定二阶有限语法树的有效单射编码 $g:\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N$：编码像可判定，各构造子及识别、取子树运算可计算。$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ 是固定具有可计算逆的可计算双射。证明系统 $\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2$ 表示证书编号与结论编号的关系；$\\mathrm{RE}$ 为 [[57-df-recursively-enumerable]] 的数集类。下述 Sound、Complete 均相对这些固定数据定义；不对任意不可有效枚举的公理真类宣称不可能性。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-so-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"fcf8e66483555f57","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2$ 取 [[57-df-so-sentence]] 中两类变量均无自由出现的二阶句子集；$\\mathrm{Sound}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})$ 与 $\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})$ 是本原子下式定义的可靠性、完备性谓词，环境 $S,g$ 和完全二阶语义固定。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S=\\widehat S_{\\mathrm{ar}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SO}","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathrm{Fml}_S^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})","display":false},{"tex":"S,g","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Code}(\\mathcal P)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle d,e\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}:\\langle d,e\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\langle d,e\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2\\;(e=g(\\sigma)\\land\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;\\mathfrak A\\models_S^2\\sigma).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Complete}(\\mathcal P,\\mathrm{SO})\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{FullSent}_S^2\\;\\left[(\\forall\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;\\mathfrak A\\models_S^2\\sigma)\\to\\exists d\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\langle d,g(\\sigma)\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\;[\\operatorname{Code}(\\mathcal P)\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land\\mathrm{Sound